{"unit_id":"techflag__dsh-friends#card-zh","repo":"techflag/dsh-friends","commit":"57fbecf58cdcc9f89d1954e0d34a2dd721194473","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 搭子 · DSH Friends 是 DSH Web 客户端的社区聊天插件。它通过 Cordis 入口注册侧栏界面，由 Host 服务连接 Nostr 中继。用户可浏览三个公共聊天室、发布和引用消息、编辑个人资料、邀请好友并进行加密文字私聊，也可开启消息提醒。适合希望在 DSH 内参与社区交流并与好友私聊的用户。无需 API Key；实时聊天需要网络连接并同意连接中继。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:7-16","src/client.tsx:1-20","src/model.ts:4-17","src/service.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"techflag__dsh-friends#card-en","repo":"techflag/dsh-friends","commit":"57fbecf58cdcc9f89d1954e0d34a2dd721194473","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Friends adds chat to DSH with a sidebar and Nostr relay connection. Users browse public rooms, post and quote messages, edit profiles, invite friends to encrypted private chats, and enable notifications. No API key is needed; live chat requires network access and relay approval.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:7-16","src/client.tsx:1-20","src/model.ts:4-17","src/service.ts:1"]}
