{"unit_id":"techflag__dsh-friends#feature-1","repo":"techflag/dsh-friends","commit":"57fbecf58cdcc9f89d1954e0d34a2dd721194473","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH 搭子** 的功能「公共聊天室与引用回复」：DSH 搭子提供大厅、插件交流和随便聊聊三个公共房间。用户可发布文本并引用已有消息回复；房间选择和草稿在客户端界面中处理，消息由 Host 服务提交到中继。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/model.ts:9-17","src/client.tsx:1"]}
{"unit_id":"techflag__dsh-friends#feature-2","repo":"techflag/dsh-friends","commit":"57fbecf58cdcc9f89d1954e0d34a2dd721194473","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH 搭子** 的功能「好友邀请与加密私聊」：DSH 搭子允许用户编辑个人资料、发现其他用户并发送好友邀请；双方确认后可发送一对一文字消息。服务端以 NIP-44/NIP-59 相关事件加密和封装私聊内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/service.ts:1","src/model.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"techflag__dsh-friends#feature-3","repo":"techflag/dsh-friends","commit":"57fbecf58cdcc9f89d1954e0d34a2dd721194473","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH 搭子** 的功能「可选消息提醒」：DSH 搭子可由用户开启或关闭消息提醒。客户端申请系统通知权限并更新设置，Host 提供通知等待与轮询数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.tsx:1","src/service.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"techflag__dsh-friends#caveat-1","repo":"techflag/dsh-friends","commit":"57fbecf58cdcc9f89d1954e0d34a2dd721194473","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 搭子默认连接 relay.techflag.cn：公共发言和公开资料以公开事件发送；私聊通过中继转发加密信封。插件不需要 API Key，创建发言身份时可设置本地保护口令。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/model.ts:4","src/service.ts:1"]}
